      "order": 1,
      "file": "hsk2_sc040_line_001.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "回到杭州以后，再看西湖感觉怎么样？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc040_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "很熟悉，也很舒服。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc040_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "旅行以后会更喜欢熟悉的地方吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc040_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "有一点儿。不过我也更想去新的地方。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc040_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "这次你觉得最大的收获是什么？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc040_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "不用把每一分钟都安排好。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc040_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "还有呢？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc040_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "计划变了也没关系。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc040_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "这两个经验以后很有用。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc040_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我也发现自己敢用中文问路、问价格了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc040_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "真实生活里的中文最容易留下来。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc040_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "对，因为马上就有结果。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc040_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "接下来可以多参加一些活动。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc040_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "认识更多人，对吧？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc040_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "对，不一定都是学习活动。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc040_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "听起来有点儿挑战，不过也很有意思。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc040_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "慢慢来，从一两个新朋友开始。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk2_sc040_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
